{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord \uff1a<u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game Is Just Getting Started\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DanDan Danmaku Gene(DDD)</i> offers two main modes: <strong>Stage Mode</strong> and <strong>Endless Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stage Mode, your goal is to create a powerful <strong>Build Card</strong>, making key decisions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Endless Mode, you'll use your Build Card to take on extreme challenges \u2014 how long can you survive?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teammate System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/5ba9283f275566eee9c41ba485ea0a60.avif?t=1753506666\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>30 unique heroes</strong> can randomly join you as teammates, each bringing their own opportunities and challenges.\u3002</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backpack System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/16888202710839fb585839bcc4d23d78.avif?t=1753506666\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unprecedented freedom in customization \u2014 to create a satisfying Build Card, you'll need to think carefully about what you truly need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfit System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/b7bb8487ce2994e1717f71955b09a07e.avif?t=1753506666\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capes and weapons aren't just cosmetics \u2014 they significantly boost your character's performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/extras/2595fa04ce9493329f7e932c8934ee05.avif?t=1753506666\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally \u2014 the <strong>Build Card</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the record of all your choices, your luck, and your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes... <i>this is where the real game begins.</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532610?t=1753506666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/94ae6ff3489f1a8fef2ebd7cbb29442594c3002f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753506666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/f14d5fe637f6abeb450a186c7d37e96fc860857f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753506666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532610/f14d5fe637f6abeb450a186c7d37e96fc860857f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753506666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3703980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord \uff1a<u></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game Is Just Getting Started\uff01</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DanDan Danmaku Gene(DDD)</i> offers two main modes: <strong>Stage Mode</strong> and <strong>Endless Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stage Mode, your goal is to create a powerful <strong>Build Card</strong>, making key de